Creating a **WeChat in-built app** for marketing purposes is not directly possible through the WeChat official app itself, as WeChat is a closed platform with strict guidelines. However, you can use **WeChat Mini Programs** (Mini Apps) to build marketing tools, landing pages, or interactive features that integrate with your brand or business.

Below is a **basic example of a WeChat Mini Program** that can be used for **marketing purposes**, such as a **product showcase**, **coupon distribution**, or **lead generation**.

---

## 📌 1. Overview of WeChat Mini Program for Marketing

WeChat Mini Programs are lightweight apps that run inside the WeChat app. They can be used for:

- Product showcases
- Coupon distribution
- Lead generation
- Customer engagement
- Event promotions
- Interactive games or quizzes

---

## 🧩 2. Basic Structure of a WeChat Mini Program

A WeChat Mini Program is built using:

- **WXML** (similar to HTML)
- **WXSS** (similar to CSS)
- **JavaScript** (for logic)
- **JSON** (for configuration)

---

## 📁 3. Example: Marketing Mini Program for Product Showcase

### 📁 Project Structure

```
/miniprogram
  ├── app.js
  ├── app.json
  ├── app.wxss
  ├── pages
  │   └── index
  │       ├── index.js
  │       ├── index.json
  │       ├── index.wxml
  │       └── index.wxss
  └── utils
      └── util.js
```

---

### 📄 `app.json` (App Configuration)

```json
{
  "pages": ["pages/index/index"],
  "window": {
    "navigationBarTitleText": "Marketing Mini Program"
  },
  "style": {
    "navigationBarTextStyle": "black"
  }
}
```

---

### 📄 `index.wxml` (Page Structure)

```html
<view class="container">
  <view class="product">
    <image src="/images/product.jpg" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="product-name">Product Name</text>
    <text class="product-price">¥99.99</text>
    <button type="primary" bindtap="addToCart">Add to Cart</button>
  </view>
</view>
```

---

### 📄 `index.js` (Page Logic)

```javascript
Page({
  data: {
    product: {
      name: "Product Name",
      price: 99.99,
      image: "/images/product.jpg"
    }
  },

  addToCart() {
    wx.showToast({
      title: 'Added to cart',
      icon: 'success'
    });
    // You can also send data to a backend or use WeChat's cloud functions
  }
});
```

---

### 📄 `index.wxss` (Page Styling)

```css
.container {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  height: 100vh;
  background-color: #f5f5f5;
}

.product {
  text-align: center;
}

.product image {
  width: 200px;
  height: 200px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.product-name {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

